Files-Excluded:
 chromium/third_party/node/linux/*
 *.wasm
 *.jar
 *.apk
Comment: This package uses Multiple Upstream Tarballs (MUT) format with components:
 - Main tarball: CEF source
 - chromium component: Chromium browser source (from Debian chromium package)
 - chromium-debian component: Debian Chromium patches and build configuration

