Files: chromium/*
Copyright: The Chromium Authors
License: BSD-3-Clause
Comment: Chromium source (MUT component), byte-identical to the Debian chromium
 package orig tarball. Complete third-party licensing for all files under
 chromium/ is documented in chromium-debian/copyright (3375 lines), which is
 also part of this source package as the chromium-debian MUT component.
 .
 This delegation avoids duplicating a 3000+ line copyright file that changes
 with every Chromium security update. When the chromium-source binary package
 exists (Bug #893448), the chromium MUT component will be replaced by a
 Build-Depends and this delegation will no longer be needed.

